        <item>
            <title>1.0.32</title>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>What's new in 1.0.32</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li><b>Talk to Berries Code</b> — type <code>@hush</code> in any Berries Code chat and it gets the Hush pill. Now hold your talk hotkey anywhere on the Mac, circle what you're looking at, and speak: the screenshot and your question land in that chat, Claude answers with your whole project in front of it, and Hush reads the answer out loud. Keep circling and asking — it all stays in the same chat.</li>
                    <li><b>It talks before it builds</b> — a connected chat discusses and diagnoses without touching your files, until you actually say "fix it".</li>
                    <li>Nothing changes when no chat is connected: the hotkey answers the way it always has.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
